\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\\n\\n<files>\\n<file path=\\\"/workspace/files/walk-input.txt\\\" />\\n</files>\"}]}]},\"output\":{\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"parts\":[{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"call_43f4f474f24e47978251f907\",\"name\":\"hello-mcp_echo\",\"arguments\":{\"message\":\"hello from the public MCP\"}}],\"finish_reason\":\"tool_call\",\"provider\":\"introspection\",\"model\":\"scripted-llm\",\"api\":\"openai-completions\",\"response_id\":\"chatcmpl-d2eb38c3d1d2453d87f409f2cad928cd\"}]},\"system_instructions\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"Use the declared hello MCP whenever the task asks you to echo a message.\\n## Managed workspace\\n\\n<workspace>\\n  <inputs path=\\\"/workspace/files\\\" access=\\\"read_write\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  <outputs path=\\\"/workspace/outputs\\\" persistence=\\\"task\\\" />\\n  Save downloaded source material under files/ and deliverables under outputs/. Mounted uploads and recipe files remain read-only; use a new path for modified copies.\\n</workspace>\\nUploaded inputs are read-only. Put intentional task deliverables in the outputs path so the platform can persist them.\\n\\n\\n## Session\\n\\n<session visibility=\\\"project\\\">\\n  <permissions plane=\\\"data\\\">annotations:read conversations:read events:read files:read files:write metrics:read shares:read shares:write tasks:read tasks:write repositories:write telemetry:write git:read</permissions>\\n</session>\\n\\n<cwd>\\n/workspace\\n</cwd>\\n\\n<current_date>\\nToday is Tuesday, November 10, 2026 (2026-11-10), in UT